&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;４　配当に関する事項&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;(1) 配当金支払額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;(2) 基準日が当連結会計年度に属する配当のうち、配当の効力発生日が当連結会計年度の末日後となるもの&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingIssuedSharesAndTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
